# AGENTS.md

This file is the assistant's operating manual. It is generated by `bootstrap.py`
on first start and re-generated when the machine's fingerprint changes.

- Everything between `ENVIRONMENT:BEGIN` and `ENVIRONMENT:END` is **generated from
  a real probe** and must never be edited by hand or guessed by the model.
- Everything else is the Operating Manual. Bootstrap writes this section once; a
  non-interactive tailoring turn may adapt it to the machine. Preserve owner
  instructions while adapting the manual. Later hand-edits survive bootstrap's
  environment refresh. Failed tailoring is retried at the next startup.
  To force a full re-probe and re-tailor, stop the bot, delete the
  `fingerprint` key from `state.db`, and start it again.

